      "title": "Bag Convergence Appoints Tanveer Azam as Chief Content Officer (Cco) and Head of Events",
      "body": "BAG Convergence has appointed Tanveer Azam as Chief Content Officer (CCO) and Head of Events. He will direct the company's overall content vision and events strategy. He will work across all of the organization's news and entertainment brands and digital-first platforms, including News24 and E24.\nTanveer began his career in 2006 and has 20 years of experience in journalism, digital content leadership, and brand development. He has worked with major companies such as Zee Media, India.com, DNA, and Microsoft. At these organizations, he played a key role in driving digital growth, content innovation, and audience engagement. His editorial expertise spans infotainment, lifestyle, tech, entertainment, and feature storytelling, with a special focus on SEO, data-driven strategies, and user-centri",
